flowchart TB
  C[tools/call action service<br/>Authorization: Bearer capability] --> J{"ES256 signature by the gateway (JWKS, kid),<br/>iss, aud = sentinel-remediation,<br/>not expired?"}
  J -->|no| X1[refuse · invalid capability token]
  J -->|yes| S{scope has<br/>remediation:execute?}
  S -->|no| X2[refuse · lacks remediation:execute]
  S -->|yes| B{claims.action = this tool and<br/>claims.target = service?}
  B -->|no| X3[refuse · capability covers other action/target]
  B -->|yes| D{dry_run?}
  D -->|yes| OKD[validated · capability NOT spent · no ops call]
  D -->|no| R{Redis SET NX jti EX ttl}
  R -->|already set| X4[refuse · capability already used]
  R -->|Redis unreachable| X5[refuse · replay protection unavailable<br/>fails closed]
  R -->|set| OPS[POST service /ops/action] --> AUD[JSON audit line with jti<br/>executed: true]
  classDef bad fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b42318,color:#1d1d1b
  classDef ok fill:#e7f5ee,stroke:#1f7a4d,color:#1d1d1b
  class X1,X2,X3,X4,X5 bad
  class OPS,AUD,OKD ok
